---
import EyebrowLabel from "../ui/EyebrowLabel.astro";
---
<section class="section-y">
  <div class="container-x">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <EyebrowLabel label="The Real Problem" />
      <h2>The mortgage process has gotten way too complicated.</h2>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-navy/90">
        Most people I meet aren't confused because they're bad with money. They're confused because they've been handed a process built around the bank's convenience, not theirs. Slow callbacks. Vague answers. Loan programs they were never told existed. After a while, it's easier to just sign whatever paperwork shows up — even when something doesn't feel right.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold text-navy">
        That's not how this should work. And that's exactly why I built Lopez Lending Group.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mx-auto mt-16 max-w-3xl border-t border-silver-dark pt-14 md:mt-20 md:pt-16">
      <EyebrowLabel label="What I Do Differently" />
      <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl">Lending that starts with listening.</h3>
      <p class="mt-5 text-lg text-navy/90">
        Because I have access to 290+ lenders, I'm not stuck selling one bank's menu. I listen first, look at your full picture, then build a strategy from the loan options that actually fit. You'll always know what's happening, why we're making each choice, and what's next.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
